  "name": "Balafon polymeter drift",
  "desc": "A hypnotic balafon built from cross-rhythmic polymeter cells: a five-note bright figure and a three-note soft figure stepped at the same pulse but of different lengths, so they drift against each other and realign only every fifteen cycles (Reichian). A low pentatonic ostinato grounds it, opposite-phase filter breaths shimmer the bars, iter and lastOf fills evolve it. Different device and mood from the hocket sibling. scale-sub transposable.",
